# `/replaceitem entity` 的**玩家**槽位。
#
# 1.12.2 的槽位号是**容器内的索引**：
#   slot.hotbar.0..8      -> 0..8
#   slot.inventory.0..26  -> 9..35
#   slot.weapon.mainhand  -> 98
#   slot.weapon.offhand   -> 99
#   slot.armor.feet/legs/chest/head -> 100/101/102/103
#   slot.enderchest.0..26 -> 200..226
#
# 玩家有自己的容器（主物品栏 36 格 + 护甲 4 格 + 副手 + 末影箱 27 格），
# 所以别的实体放不进去的槽位，玩家可以。
#
# 这一轮只测玩家，因为玩家要靠协议机器人在线，跑得慢。
#
# bot: Steve

--- console ---
say P01
replaceitem entity Steve slot.weapon.mainhand stone
say P02
replaceitem entity Steve slot.weapon.offhand stone
say P03
replaceitem entity Steve slot.armor.head stone
say P04
replaceitem entity Steve slot.armor.chest stone
say P05
replaceitem entity Steve slot.armor.legs stone
say P06
replaceitem entity Steve slot.armor.feet stone
say P07
replaceitem entity Steve slot.hotbar.0 stone
say P08
replaceitem entity Steve slot.hotbar.8 stone
say P09
replaceitem entity Steve slot.inventory.0 stone
say P10
replaceitem entity Steve slot.inventory.26 stone
say P11
replaceitem entity Steve slot.enderchest.0 stone
say P12
replaceitem entity Steve slot.enderchest.26 stone
say P13
replaceitem entity Steve slot.container.0 stone
say P14
replaceitem entity Steve slot.container.53 stone
say P15
replaceitem entity Steve slot.villager.0 stone
say P16
replaceitem entity Steve slot.horse.saddle stone
say P17
replaceitem entity Steve slot.horse.0 stone
say P18
replaceitem entity Steve slot.inventory.27 stone
say P19
replaceitem entity Steve slot.enderchest.27 stone
say P20
replaceitem entity Steve slot.container.54 stone
say P21
replaceitem entity Steve slot.armor.hand stone
say P22
replaceitem entity Steve slot.weapon stone
say P23
